.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-DIFF 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-diff
.Nd what changed between two capsules
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis diff
.Op Fl j | Fl -json
.Ar dir dir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis diff
compares two capsule folders, the first as before and the second as
after, and prints one row per difference:
.Bl -tag -width schema
.It file
a file added, removed or changed (size and SHA-256) between the two
manifests, when both folders are sealed
.It source
a source added or removed in the data records
.Pq Xr noqtis-data 5 ,
or the fields that changed, old and new
.It schema
a column added, removed or changed (its type, missing values, range),
another field of a schema (rows, delimiter, rules), or the columns in
another order
.It stats
a summary's row count, a column added or removed, a column's count,
median and the population stability index between the two summaries
(over the same bins, or over the categories of either), another field
of a summary (delimiter, header), or the columns in another order
.It env , cite
fields that changed, or the member added or removed
.It steps , commits
how many there are, and the first that differs
.It check
a recorded check added, removed or changed
.El
.Pp
A
.Ql manifest
row says when only one folder is sealed (a difference), or neither (the
files are not compared); a
.Ql record
row, when only one holds a data record.
Two folders can be compared only as far as they read: a seal or
manifest that is there but does not read, a data record that is there
but does not load, or two folders with neither a seal nor a record give
a row that says so and exit status 2, never
.Dq the same .
.Pp
Nothing is checked: a seal or record that does not verify is compared
as it reads.
Run
.Xr noqtis-check 1
and
.Cm noqtis data check
on each first.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl j , Fl -json
Print one line of JSON:
.Bd -literal
{"from":"<dir>","to":"<dir>","same":<bool>,
 "rows":[{"what":"<kind>","differs":<bool>,"detail":"<text>"},...]}
.Ed
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
nothing differs
.It 1
something does
.It 2
a usage error, a path that is not a folder, or two folders that cannot
be compared (a seal, manifest or data record there that does not read,
or nothing to compare)
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ noqtis diff results-2025 results-2026
      manifest  3 files, then 3
diff  file      data/a.csv changed: 89 -> 111 bytes, SHA-256 7a16...
diff  schema    data/a.csv: rows {"max":3,"min":3} -> {"max":4,"min":4}
results-2025 and results-2026: 2 differences
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis-check 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-data 1 ,
.Xr nqddiff 3 ,
.Xr noqtis-data 5
